      },
      "message": "fix: adapt onnx module to ort 2.0.0-rc.12 final API\n\nFixes SuperInstance/pincher#10 — --features onnx compilation broken by\nadditional API drift in ort 2.0.0-rc.12 beyond the Session::builder()\nchain already fixed in 9fc2e49.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove ort::prelude import (removed in rc.12)\n- Wrap Session in Arc<Mutex<>> (not Send-safe in rc.12)\n- Update session.run() return type handling (try_extract_tensor returns\n  (&Shape, &[T]) tuple, not a typed tensor)\n- Replace output[[i,j,k]] indexing with flat index into data slice\n- Handle shape.len() returning isize vs usize\n- Fix attention_mask cloning for moved-from-array semantics\n- Add mutex error mapping to EmbedError::Ort\n\nBuild verified: cargo build --features onnx -p pincher-core (debug + release)\nTesting blocked: ort_sys prebuilt archives lack ARM64 exception handling\ntables (__cxa_call_terminate) — not a code issue.",
