      "message": "fix: pin ndarray 0.17 and adapt ort 2.0.0-rc.12 API for Session builder error handling\n\nUpstream API drift in ort 2.0.0-rc.12:\n- Session::builder() now returns Result<Session, ort::Error<()>> requiring\n  explicit map_err on each method chain\n- GraphOptimizationLevel moved to ort::session::builder::\n- ort::Error<()> no longer auto-converts from builder errors\n\nAlso bump ndarray from 0.16 to 0.17 for compatibility.",
