      "message": "Rewrite README with shell-and-signal narrative\n\nFull rewrite of the pincher README using the hermit-crab / shell-and-signal\nnarrative framework from the AI Writings essays and the official design system.\n\nNew structure:\n- Opening: hermit-crab hook + reflex engine positioning\n- The Shell: what pincher is, how reflexes work, the intent->action pipeline\n- The Signal: the pinch protocol, how triggers and actions flow through the shell\n- The Architecture: Rust workspace, crate layout, la-link diagram\n- The Fleet Context: how pincher fits in the SuperInstance stack\n- Quick Start: minimal install + reflex config\n- Design: brass/copper/teal palette reference\n- Footer: 'The crab inherits the shell.'\n\n~230 lines, ~14KB.",
